 **Data Structures:**
-*   **Stencil Buffer:** 1-bit or integer buffer tracking occlusion status [G].
-*   **Shadow Planes:** Geometry derived from object silhouettes relative to the light source [G].
+*   **Stencil Buffer:** Integer buffer tracking occlusion status for shadow volume logic [S1, unofficial].
